     <p><b>Stance: hierarchy</b> is a different kind of score. It asks whether the idea thinks some people, beings or powers rightly stand above others. <b>+5</b> strongly favors that kind of ranked order, <b>0</b> is neutral or mixed, <b>−5</b> strongly opposes it. Every idea has one, root ideas included, and it sets the front-back position.</p>
